 "sentences": [
  "John Adair was a soldier, politician, and slave trader.",
  "Born in 1757, he fought in the Revolutionary War and was captured twice by the British.",
  "He later moved to Kentucky and fought in the Northwest Indian War against Chief Little Turtle.",
  "Adair served in the U.S. House, the Senate, and as Kentucky's eighth governor.",
  "He even helped write the state's constitution before becoming Speaker of the House."
